json_fields.go adapts encoding/json field selection from Go 1.25.8
(src/encoding/json/encode.go and tags.go). Copyright 2010, 2011 The Go Authors.
The original BSD license is retained in JSON_FIELDS_LICENSE.
Adaptation exposes linked-type field metadata on shape.Type, omits encoding,
unsafe/linkname/cache machinery, and records nil anonymous-holder reachability.
No standard-library encoder behavior is changed. This metadata describes
encoding/json v1, not goexperiment.jsonv2 or another serializer.
